WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.452
Welcome to ChurchApps. Every tool here is free, with no limits, no premium tiers, and no hidden fees. That's because ChurchApps is built by the Church, for the Church.

2
00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:19.297
We're a nonprofit, supported by donations and volunteers. We believe the tools that help a church do ministry should be shared, not sold. Today, more than forty thousand churches use them.

3
00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:26.242
B1 Admin is your church management dashboard. People, groups, attendance, giving, and your website, all in one place.

4
00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:32.861
B1 dot church is your public website and member app, where your people watch sermons, give, and stay connected.

5
00:00:33.861 --> 00:00:37.437
Lessons dot church has free curriculum for kids, students, and adults.

6
00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:44.149
FreePlay puts your lessons, worship videos, and announcements on the classroom TV, and it can even run on a schedule.

7
00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:48.400
FreeShow is free presentation software for your worship services.

8
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.393
And WorshipCommons is an open library of worship music your church can sing free.

9
00:00:54.393 --> 00:01:01.034
This guide walks you through it, one step at a time. Create your account, set up your church, add your team, and start using the tools.

10
00:01:02.034 --> 00:01:04.496
Start with Creating Your Account. We're glad you're here.
